# Upload rules for Vercel. This file REPLACES .gitignore for deployments, which is the
# point: .gitignore excludes *.db and re-includes the snapshot with `!data/jobfinder.db`,
# and Vercel's uploader does not honour that negation. The snapshot was silently left out
# of the bundle, so the function fell back to a database path that did not exist and died
# during startup — every route returning 500, including ones that do not exist.
#
# data/jobfinder.db is deliberately absent from this file. It is the only reason the site
# has anything to serve.

# The local virtualenv and the full crawl database: large, and neither is served.
job/
/jobfinder.db
*.db-journal

# Secrets never belong in a bundle; Vercel injects its own environment.
.env
.env.*

# Nothing here runs in production.
tests/
reports/
scripts/
.github/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.git/
.DS_Store
